        <mxCell id="c114" value="+ new(manifest, spec) · warm_up()&lt;br&gt;+ call(…) · reset() · shutdown()&lt;br&gt;+ sandbox() · granted(permission)" style="fontFamily=Consolas,Menlo,monospace;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1990" y="640" width="250" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c115" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;imt-plugins --plugin &amp;lt;id&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#5A6375&quot;&gt;[child process · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;imt_plugin_api::serve&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;Postcard frames over an owner-only named pipe or a Unix socket in a private folder (never TCP); address and token on stdin; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;Hello&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;Welcome&lt;/span&gt; carry the frame and protocol versions. Sandbox from the manifest: AppContainer or low integrity and a job object (Windows), landlock and seccomp (Linux), sandbox profile (macOS); memory watched by the host. Third-party programs are launched the same way, contained before their first instruction." style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;rounded=1;arcSize=8;absoluteArcSize=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#A664FE;fillColor=#F2E8FF;spacing=8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1720" y="800" width="520" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
